    "detail": {
      "id": 1350063,
      "name": "[Astra Yao] Starfall Waltz",
      "desc": "For every 25 Energy consumed, Astra Yao gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Starlight</color>, up to 3 stacks. During <color=#FFFFFF>Idyllic Cadenza</color>, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to unleash <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Radiant Moment</color>, continuously channeling an energy beam to attack enemies. Upon activating this skill, <color=#FFFFFF>Starlight</color> will be consumed, and with each stack consumed <color=#2BAD00>the skill duration will extend by 1s</color>. During this skill, <color=#2BAD00>Anti-Interrupt Level is increased</color>, and <color=#2BAD00>DMG taken is further reduced by 20%</color>. When the skill hits enemies, the <color=#2BAD00>target's DEF is reduced by 20%</color> for 30s. With 3 stacks of <color=#FFFFFF>Starlight</color>, switching back to Astra Yao will automatically trigger <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Radiant Moment</color>. When Astra Yao's <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Interlude</color> hits enemies, it will consume 25 additional Energy, and when <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Chorus</color> hits enemies, it will <color=#2BAD00>restore 5 additional Energy</color>.",
